title: Ferris Wheel
text: Red on the way up, blue at the top, red again by the time you get off. If the colours don't come round right, the whole wheel blurs to white.
trick: a fixed splitter feeds the beam round a loop and back into itself; two dopplers on the loop must undo each other, or every lap shifts again and the loop goes white
motif: a ferris wheel: a square wheel with a spoke up the middle, on an A-frame stand of occupied squares
ink: 4
expect: recolours>=2
accept: idea
